{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《武庫》\n題篇之說，詳見於後癸酉年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梁乃\n湛堂姓也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即慈\n濟大師實緣，嗣北塔祚和尚，奉敕住南華，與雲峰悅和尚厚善"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時師得陳瑩中書，欲再往荊州訪無盡居士"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《七會錄》以「相與建法幢」為雲居上堂，非也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自敘云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "讚見後錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鈍叟，尚明自號也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "政和元年辛卯持缽，至紹興七年丁巳，計二十七年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十八日，\n太保韓公世忠、少師張公俊充樞密使，少保岳公飛充樞密副使"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "衡陽有回鴈峰、瀟湘石鼓灘，自\n辛酉至庚午移梅陽恰十年，或云古者以梅木為弓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道得末後句，則不孤\n負老僧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "龍王聖屬出現綵亭之上，舉眾見其冠白"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗演"}
